const pricing=()=>pageShell(`<section class="section pricing-system"><div class="wrap"><div class="pricing-intro"><h2>Choose the operating tier that fits your workload.</h2><p>Start free, upgrade as evidence volume grows, or define a deployment boundary with us.</p></div><div class="price-grid"><article class="price"><h3>Free</h3><strong>$0<small>/mo</small></strong><p>Start building at no cost.</p><b class="price-limit">10K writes · 10K recalls</b><ul><li>Memory writes and recalls</li><li>Semantic search</li><li>Open source core</li></ul><a class="text-link" href="/upgrade">Get started →</a></article><article class="price"><h3>Starter</h3><strong>$15<small>/mo</small></strong><p>For growing projects.</p><b class="price-limit">100K writes · 50K recalls</b><ul><li>Everything in Free</li><li>Domain adapters</li><li>Audit log and lineage</li></ul><a class="text-link" href="/upgrade">Choose Starter →</a></article><article class="price"><h3>Growth</h3><strong>$69<small>/mo</small></strong><p>For production workloads.</p><b class="price-limit">500K writes · 250K recalls</b><ul><li>Everything in Starter</li><li>Conflict detection and webhooks</li><li>Reports and Merkle audit chain</li></ul><a class="text-link" href="/upgrade">Choose Growth →</a></article><article class="price featured"><h3>Pro</h3><strong>$199<small>/mo</small></strong><p>For established production teams.</p><b class="price-limit">2M writes · 1M recalls</b><ul><li>Everything in Growth</li><li>Backtest checks</li><li>Prometheus metrics and priority support</li></ul><a class="text-link" href="/upgrade">Choose Pro →</a></article><article class="price"><h3>Enterprise</h3><strong>Custom</strong><p>For deployment-bound controls.</p><b class="price-limit">Unlimited writes · unlimited recalls</b><ul><li>Information barriers and custom KMS</li><li>Air-gap deployment</li><li>Security review, onboarding, and SLA</li></ul><a class="text-link" href="/design-partners">Talk to us →</a></article></div><div class="implementation-offer"><div><h2>Need us in the room?</h2><p>A fixed-scope implementation for one consequential production workflow.</p></div><strong>$25,000</strong><ul><li>Instrumentation design</li><li>Evidence reconstruction</li><li>Evidence acceptance suite</li></ul><a class="button" href="/design-partners">Plan an implementation →</a></div><div class="implementation-map"><div class="implementation-copy"><h2>Eight weeks. Four concrete handoffs.</h2><p>The engagement moves from one traced workflow to an evidence package your team can inspect and verify.</p></div><div class="implementation-rail" aria-label="Eight-week implementation timeline"><article><span>WEEKS 1–2</span><b>Map</b><p>Workflow and evidence boundary</p></article><i>→</i><article><span>WEEKS 3–4</span><b>Instrument</b><p>OTLP spans and source links</p></article><i>→</i><article><span>WEEKS 5–6</span><b>Reconstruct</b><p>Historical decision replay</p></article><i>→</i><article><span>WEEKS 7–8</span><b>Verify</b><p>Acceptance suite and receipt</p></article></div></div></div></section>`);
